**1-week**: 5 trading days. Slight uncertainty expansion. Weekly σ ≈ $4.50-5.50. Macro/tariff news could move it.

**1-month**: ~22 trading days. Monthly σ ≈ $9-11. Earnings risk, macro conditions, consumer sentiment all factor in. Slight downward bias given retail headwinds and tariff uncertainty.

For 90% CI, I use approximately ±1.645σ from the point estimate.

